                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "[h1] Maximum Speed [/h1]\nIt doesn’t quite have the impact of the first game because it lacks the mystery and the presentation around that mystery that the first game had.\n\nI like Psycho and I liked the idea to make the game’s storytelling more centered on him, but both story and execution of it feels unpolished and underwhelming.\n\nOther than those points, it’s a good play if you’re looking for more of the feel of the first game. The later games in the series went with a different approach, and this one feels more like the first game.",
